Borrowed designs
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The workflow trace event format (shared format A) borrows the structure of
OpenTelemetry spans — trace id, span id, parent span id, start and end times,
attributes, status. The OpenTelemetry specification is published by the Cloud
Native Computing Foundation under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
No OpenTelemetry code is included.
